        <activityName xml:lang="en">Process-specific burdens, slag compartment</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Process-specific burdens, slag compartment
slag compartment for bottom ash from municipal solid waste incinerator. The compartment is a sealed-off part of a sanitary landfill.;
UUID: ecdf22c7-d4e1-4421-9a03-1315367c1808
process-specific (i.e. independent of waste composition) energy demand and land use of landfill
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: landfill with base seal, leachate collection system. Renaturation after closure.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: data from one literature source on sanitary landfill, adapted to features of this landfill type 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ecdf22c7-d4e1-4421-9a03-1315367c1808.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
